+         register but without a coordinate showed the user a failure card.
+         Measured on the live page: between 3 and 8 of 20 MAP links carry no
+         coordinate at all, so there was nothing to fall back to either.
+
+         Offshore is where this bites. 8 of 101 offshore rows carry no easting
+         or northing, and the Crown Estate leases the seabed under them, so a
+         derived point exists for 6 of the 8 in atlas/data/offshore-coordinates.json.
